<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia confirms bought 100,000 tonnes feed barley.</title>
<headline>Tunisia confirms bought 100,000 tonnes feed barley.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia on Friday confirmed it bought four lots of 25,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley each at $136.64 per tonne cost and freight at a tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>The state buying body Office des Cereales said shipment dates are May 10-20, June 10-20, July 10-20 and August 10-20.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 216-1-787538</p>
